{"id":"b0618eb9c08a1bca","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-atr0.md","title":"Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion","display":"df-atr0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-atr0","aliases":["72-df-atr0"],"display":"df-atr0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion","depends_on":["[[72-df-aca0]]","[[72-df-coded-well-order]]","[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-atr0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-atr0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atr0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"89c91257b92fc1e7\" href=\"?note=89c91257b92fc1e7\" title=\"72-df-aca0\">72-df-aca0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33bb5f7820ca84c2\" href=\"?note=33bb5f7820ca84c2\" title=\"72-df-coded-well-order\">72-df-coded-well-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.3, print271–273/PDF283–285; definitions supplemented by Simpson, SOSOA 2nd ed., §§I.2–I.11, <a href=\"https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sgslogic.net/t20/sosoa/chapter1.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>语法、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ae195683ce3beb4\" href=\"?note=5ae195683ce3beb4\" title=\"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax\">72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathsf{ACA}_0\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"89c91257b92fc1e7\" href=\"?note=89c91257b92fc1e7\" title=\"72-df-aca0\">72-df-aca0</a>；配对公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"33bb5f7820ca84c2\" href=\"?note=33bb5f7820ca84c2\" title=\"72-df-coded-well-order\">72-df-coded-well-order</a>。所有对象语言联结词按该语法的缩写展开。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(A,B)\\)</span> 的输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)\">\\(A,B,C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in V_S\">\\(Z\\in V_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in V_N\">\\(z\\in V_N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为数项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,w\">\\(y,w\\)</span> 为数变量。它仅替换原公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 为集参数的隶属原子，不继续替换新插入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{new}_N(F),\\operatorname{new}_S(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{new}_N(F),\\operatorname{new}_S(F)\\)</span> 仅对有限变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 定义。</li>\n<li>超限递归模式的参数域为下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 是输出数变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是待替换集参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,R\">\\(D,R\\)</span> 是域和关系参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\theta,n,Z,D,R}\">\\(H_{\\theta,n,Z,D,R}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_{\\theta,n},z_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n},m_{\\theta,n}\">\\(a_{\\theta,n},z_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n},m_{\\theta,n}\\)</span> 由下式唯一选定；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R)\\)</span> 的展开式内分别缩写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,a,z,b,m\">\\(H,a,z,b,m\\)</span>，不引入额外自由选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{new}_N(F)&amp;:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin F\\}},\\qquad\\operatorname{new}_S(F):=X_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:X_i\\notin F\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreshMem}(C,B,z,y)&amp;:=\\operatorname{new}_N(\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B)\\cup\\{z,y\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(t\\in Z,B)&amp;:=B[t/z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(A,B)&amp;:=A\\quad\\bigl(A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(\\varnothing)\\setminus\\{t\\in Z:t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\neg C,B)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C\\to C&#39;,B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B)\\to\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C&#39;,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\forall yC,B)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall y\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B),&amp;y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C[w/y],B),&amp;y\\in\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\ w=\\operatorname{FreshMem}(C,B,z,y).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{new}_N(F)&amp;:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin F\\}},\\qquad\\operatorname{new}_S(F):=X_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:X_i\\notin F\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreshMem}(C,B,z,y)&amp;:=\\operatorname{new}_N(\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B)\\cup\\{z,y\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(t\\in Z,B)&amp;:=B[t/z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(A,B)&amp;:=A\\quad\\bigl(A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(\\varnothing)\\setminus\\{t\\in Z:t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\neg C,B)&amp;:=\\neg\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C\\to C&#39;,B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B)\\to\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C&#39;,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\forall yC,B)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall y\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B),&amp;y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C[w/y],B),&amp;y\\in\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\ w=\\operatorname{FreshMem}(C,B,z,y).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\theta,n,Z,D,R\\rangle:\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing),\\ n\\in V_N,\\ Z,D,R\\in V_S,\\ |\\{Z,D,R\\}|=3,\\ \\{D,R\\}\\cap\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nF_{\\theta,n}&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(\\theta)\\cup\\{n\\},\\\\\nu_0(\\theta,n)&amp;:=\\operatorname{new}_N(F_{\\theta,n}),\\qquad u_{i+1}(\\theta,n):=\\operatorname{new}_N(F_{\\theta,n}\\cup\\{u_j(\\theta,n):j\\le i\\})\\quad(i&lt;3),\\\\\n\\langle a_{\\theta,n},z_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n},m_{\\theta,n}\\rangle&amp;:=\\langle u_0(\\theta,n),u_1(\\theta,n),u_2(\\theta,n),u_3(\\theta,n)\\rangle,\\\\\nH_{\\theta,n,Z,D,R}&amp;:=\\operatorname{new}_S(F_{\\theta,n}\\cup\\{Z,D,R\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Before}_{\\theta,n}(H,D,R,a;z)&amp;:=\\exists b_{\\theta,n}\\,\\exists m_{\\theta,n}\\,\\bigl(z=\\langle m_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n}\\rangle\\land b_{\\theta,n}\\in D\\land a\\in D\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\langle b_{\\theta,n},a\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle m_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n}\\rangle\\in H\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\to\\exists H\\bigl(\\forall z(z\\in H\\to\\exists n\\,\\exists a(a\\in D\\land z=\\langle n,a\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\\forall a(a\\in D\\to\\forall n(\\langle n,a\\rangle\\in H\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\theta,\\operatorname{Before}_{\\theta,n}(H,D,R,a;z))))\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ATR}_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{ACA}_0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R):\\langle\\theta,n,Z,D,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\theta,n,Z,D,R\\rangle:\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing),\\ n\\in V_N,\\ Z,D,R\\in V_S,\\ |\\{Z,D,R\\}|=3,\\ \\{D,R\\}\\cap\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nF_{\\theta,n}&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(\\theta)\\cup\\{n\\},\\\\\nu_0(\\theta,n)&amp;:=\\operatorname{new}_N(F_{\\theta,n}),\\qquad u_{i+1}(\\theta,n):=\\operatorname{new}_N(F_{\\theta,n}\\cup\\{u_j(\\theta,n):j\\le i\\})\\quad(i&lt;3),\\\\\n\\langle a_{\\theta,n},z_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n},m_{\\theta,n}\\rangle&amp;:=\\langle u_0(\\theta,n),u_1(\\theta,n),u_2(\\theta,n),u_3(\\theta,n)\\rangle,\\\\\nH_{\\theta,n,Z,D,R}&amp;:=\\operatorname{new}_S(F_{\\theta,n}\\cup\\{Z,D,R\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Before}_{\\theta,n}(H,D,R,a;z)&amp;:=\\exists b_{\\theta,n}\\,\\exists m_{\\theta,n}\\,\\bigl(z=\\langle m_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n}\\rangle\\land b_{\\theta,n}\\in D\\land a\\in D\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\langle b_{\\theta,n},a\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle m_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n}\\rangle\\in H\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\to\\exists H\\bigl(\\forall z(z\\in H\\to\\exists n\\,\\exists a(a\\in D\\land z=\\langle n,a\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\\forall a(a\\in D\\to\\forall n(\\langle n,a\\rangle\\in H\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\theta,\\operatorname{Before}_{\\theta,n}(H,D,R,a;z))))\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ATR}_0&amp;:=\\mathsf{ACA}_0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R):\\langle\\theta,n,Z,D,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用 ACA₀ 加算术超限递归模式。递归算子并不要求对 Z 正出现。MemSub 是明确的捕获避免公式替换，不把较早切片误作语言中未定义的集合项。参数域、新鲜变量和递归历史公式均在前两节固定；良序性仍是对象公式中的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-aca0","status":"resolved","id":"89c91257b92fc1e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-aca0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-coded-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"33bb5f7820ca84c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-coded-well-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"5ae195683ce3beb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语法、$\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]；$\\mathsf{ACA}_0$ 取 [[72-df-aca0]]；配对公式与 $\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]]。所有对象语言联结词按该语法的缩写展开。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-aca0","status":"resolved","id":"89c91257b92fc1e7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语法、$\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]；$\\mathsf{ACA}_0$ 取 [[72-df-aca0]]；配对公式与 $\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]]。所有对象语言联结词按该语法的缩写展开。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-coded-well-order","status":"resolved","id":"33bb5f7820ca84c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语法、$\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)$ 取 [[72-df-second-order-arithmetic-syntax]]；$\\mathsf{ACA}_0$ 取 [[72-df-aca0]]；配对公式与 $\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)$ 取 [[72-df-coded-well-order]]。所有对象语言联结词按该语法的缩写展开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{QVar},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{ucl},\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ACA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C,C'\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"y,w","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{new}_N(F),\\operatorname{new}_S(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"D,R","display":false},{"tex":"H_{\\theta,n,Z,D,R}","display":false},{"tex":"a_{\\theta,n},z_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n},m_{\\theta,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"H,a,z,b,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{new}_N(F)&:=x_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:x_i\\notin F\\}},\\qquad\\operatorname{new}_S(F):=X_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:X_i\\notin F\\}},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreshMem}(C,B,z,y)&:=\\operatorname{new}_N(\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(B)\\cup\\{z,y\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(t\\in Z,B)&:=B[t/z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(A,B)&:=A\\quad\\bigl(A\\in\\operatorname{At}_2(\\varnothing)\\setminus\\{t\\in Z:t\\in\\operatorname{Trm}_2(\\varnothing)\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\neg C,B)&:=\\neg\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C\\to C',B)&:=\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B)\\to\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C',B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\forall yC,B)&:=\\begin{cases}\\forall y\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C,B),&y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\\\\\forall w\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(C[w/y],B),&y\\in\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\setminus\\{z\\},\\ w=\\operatorname{FreshMem}(C,B,z,y).\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}&:=\\{\\langle\\theta,n,Z,D,R\\rangle:\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Arith}_2(\\varnothing),\\ n\\in V_N,\\ Z,D,R\\in V_S,\\ |\\{Z,D,R\\}|=3,\\ \\{D,R\\}\\cap\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nF_{\\theta,n}&:=\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\cup\\operatorname{QVar}(\\theta)\\cup\\{n\\},\\\\\nu_0(\\theta,n)&:=\\operatorname{new}_N(F_{\\theta,n}),\\qquad u_{i+1}(\\theta,n):=\\operatorname{new}_N(F_{\\theta,n}\\cup\\{u_j(\\theta,n):j\\le i\\})\\quad(i<3),\\\\\n\\langle a_{\\theta,n},z_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n},m_{\\theta,n}\\rangle&:=\\langle u_0(\\theta,n),u_1(\\theta,n),u_2(\\theta,n),u_3(\\theta,n)\\rangle,\\\\\nH_{\\theta,n,Z,D,R}&:=\\operatorname{new}_S(F_{\\theta,n}\\cup\\{Z,D,R\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Before}_{\\theta,n}(H,D,R,a;z)&:=\\exists b_{\\theta,n}\\,\\exists m_{\\theta,n}\\,\\bigl(z=\\langle m_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n}\\rangle\\land b_{\\theta,n}\\in D\\land a\\in D\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\land\\langle b_{\\theta,n},a\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle m_{\\theta,n},b_{\\theta,n}\\rangle\\in H\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R)&:=\\operatorname{ucl}\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\to\\exists H\\bigl(\\forall z(z\\in H\\to\\exists n\\,\\exists a(a\\in D\\land z=\\langle n,a\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\land\\forall a(a\\in D\\to\\forall n(\\langle n,a\\rangle\\in H\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{MemSub}_{Z,z}(\\theta,\\operatorname{Before}_{\\theta,n}(H,D,R,a;z))))\\bigr)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ATR}_0&:=\\mathsf{ACA}_0\\cup\\{\\operatorname{TR}(\\theta;n,Z,D,R):\\langle\\theta,n,Z,D,R\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm TR}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4560,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-atr0|df-atr0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-atr0|df-atr0 — Arithmetical Transfinite Recursion]]"},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["89c91257b92fc1e7","33bb5f7820ca84c2","5ae195683ce3beb4"]}